msgid "After this many minutes of real use, apply a tighter limit. 30 4 means 4 Mbps each way, 30 4 2 means 4 Mbps down and 2 Mbps up, and 90 block cuts off access. Up to 4 steps, for example 30 4, then 60 2, then 90 block. Traffic is unlimited before the first step. When any step is set, these steps replace the allowance above and the action on the Rule tab. Counts are cleared with the time window."
msgstr ""

